1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 17]</font>

15
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui, today, we...</font>

16
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on.</font>

17
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must recite the incantation first.</font>

18
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

19
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui.</font>

20
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The three of us</font>

21
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are repenting sincerely.</font>

22
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's coming!</font>

23
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know, I know.</font>

24
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is he in the back?</font>

25
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It sounds like it.</font>

26
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui.</font>

27
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui.</font>

28
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That wasn't our fault!</font>

29
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We never imagined</font>

30
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would lose your life</font>

31
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over something like this that day.</font>

32
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

33
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please spare us!</font>

34
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was you who killed me.</font>

35
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will make you pay</font>

36
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with your lives.</font>

37
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui,</font>

38
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">listen to me.</font>

39
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We only wanted you
to hand over the token.</font>

40
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wanted to quit.</font>

41
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But we couldn't.</font>

42
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

43
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

44
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we only made you</font>

45
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take that medicine</font>

46
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because our minds were clouded.</font>

47
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't know you'd slip and fall.</font>

48
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

49
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

50
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I saw Cui fall down there.</font>

51
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was that Cui?</font>

52
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why does it sound to me</font>

53
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a woman's voice?</font>

54
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is no time</font>

55
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be thinking about women.</font>

56
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard it too.</font>

57
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

58
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should we go check?</font>

59
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go look.</font>

60
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Why me again?
- Go!</font>

61
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

62
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, come on.</font>

63
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you two doing here?</font>

64
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little rascal.</font>

65
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just now,</font>

66
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you scared me half to death.</font>

67
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

68
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you all right?</font>

69
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, get up.</font>

70
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that it?</font>

71
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were looking for me just now</font>

72
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to write an article, right?</font>

73
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, it's right over there.</font>

74
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

75
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I say you three could move?</font>

76
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

77
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you explain to Mr. Jiang?</font>

78
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We haven't done anything wrong.</font>

79
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just let us go, please.</font>

80
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were just studying hard.</font>

81
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're stopping us from studying.</font>

82
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, we're trying to study here.</font>

83
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not class time.</font>

84
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're working on a case.</font>

85
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even I can't interfere.</font>

86
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You left the broken rope</font>

87
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by the well, didn't you?</font>

88
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you know?</font>

89
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I simply borrowed your little trick.</font>

90
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A broken rope tied to a tree branch</font>

91
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be your ghost-making prop.</font>

92
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You went through all that trouble</font>

93
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to find a secluded spot</font>

94
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to use that shady stuff.</font>

95
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am,</font>

96
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're policing our snacks now?</font>

97
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Divine Dust</font>

98
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is hardly an ordinary snack.</font>

99
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, you...</font>

100
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unless you want your elders to know,</font>

101
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">behave yourself.</font>

102
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

103
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've told you everything.</font>

104
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What more do you want?</font>

105
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

106
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so hasty.</font>

107
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This ghost chose
to haunt only you three.</font>

108
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be someone who knows the truth.</font>

109
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think carefully.</font>

110
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:42,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did anyone else know</font>

111
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the Divine Dust?</font>

112
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

113
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

114
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Definitely not.</font>

115
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

116
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there was one person</font>

117
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who saw it.</font>

118
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

119
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he's already dead.</font>

120
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

121
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's dead.</font>

122
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun Mingcheng?</font>

123
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

124
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely impossible.</font>

125
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way. Impossible.</font>

126
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We beat him so badly</font>

127
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he was begging on his knees.</font>

128
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, right.</font>

129
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was him. He did the beating.</font>

130
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

131
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you hit him too?</font>

132
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I didn't.</font>

133
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Very good.</font>

134
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was all you.</font>

135
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. Back then,</font>

136
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our methods were indeed a bit rough.</font>

137
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

138
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if you gave him</font>

139
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a hundred times the nerve,</font>

140
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he wouldn't dare breathe
a word of it to anyone.</font>

141
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

142
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, he died a day before Cui Tai.</font>

143
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His broke father threw a grand funeral.</font>

144
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, we'd never have noticed</font>

145
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he didn't show up at the academy.</font>

146
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

147
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A grand funeral?</font>

148
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

149
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His father</font>

150
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was a scholar
who compiled classic texts.</font>

151
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His family was dirt poor.</font>

152
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was dead set on sending his only son</font>

153
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Shangxue Academy,</font>

154
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he tried every trick in the book,</font>

155
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">emptying the family coffers.</font>

156
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They lived hand to mouth.</font>

157
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me put it to you this way.</font>

158
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even a rat scrounging through his house</font>

159
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would leave with tears in its eyes.</font>

160
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you imagine how poor they were?</font>

161
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So poor!</font>

162
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

163
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

164
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then he found out his son was dead</font>

165
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and perhaps felt a bit guilty,</font>

166
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so he rounded up loads of people</font>

167
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to attend the funeral.</font>

168
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the point?</font>

169
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He should've given the boy
more money when he was alive.</font>

170
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the use of splurging
when he's dead?</font>

171
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

172
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how did you suddenly appear
at Scholar's Grove?</font>

173
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I borrowed someone to catch a ghost.</font>

174
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you borrowed a ghost
to catch someone.</font>

175
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We do have a certain chemistry.</font>

176
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

177
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Shangxue Academy</font>

178
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is full of your spies.</font>

179
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You put yourself in such grave danger</font>

180
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all to set this trap, right?</font>

181
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

182
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, how would I know</font>

183
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why you're lying low
at Shangxue Academy?</font>

184
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remain at the academy</font>

185
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">simply to recuperate</font>

186
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and teach on the side.</font>

187
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A seasoned warrior like you</font>

188
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">chooses to teach</font>

189
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at Shangxue Academy in the end?</font>

190
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How absurd.</font>

191
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia Bohou and his gang punched Cui Tai</font>

192
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over the token.</font>

193
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A mystery man played ghost</font>

194
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to steal a sachet.</font>

195
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these incidents revolve
around one thing:</font>

196
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What they call Divine Dust.</font>

197
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You entered the academy</font>

198
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right after Cui Tai's death</font>

199
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the name of recuperation.</font>

200
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's merely a cover.</font>

201
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're actually investigating
the Divine Dust.</font>

202
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I right?</font>

203
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

204
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't hide anything from you.</font>

205
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your health is in such a state.</font>

206
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you the only loyal minister
in Beiyuan?</font>

207
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I receive the court's stipend,</font>

208
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I must serve with loyalty.</font>

209
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't worry about the greater good</font>

210
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and loyal subjects.</font>

211
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In my heart,</font>

212
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are first Li Congyao,</font>

213
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and only then Prince Duan of Beiyuan.</font>

214
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

215
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:38,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you please not make things</font>

216
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sound so simple?</font>

217
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:42,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

218
00:07:42,930 --> 00:07:44,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

219
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

220
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

221
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

222
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I agree to what you said</font>

223
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the night of the Shangsi Festival.</font>

224
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life's meetings and partings
are like this.</font>

225
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy the time we have together.</font>

226
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You told me this.</font>

227
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've already wasted five years.</font>

228
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much more time
can you afford to lose?</font>

229
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Jun Qinglan of today</font>

230
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is capable of protecting herself</font>

231
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you.</font>

232
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:22,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

233
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:27,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

234
00:08:27,450 --> 00:08:30,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

235
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:35,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

236
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shangxue Academy]</font>

237
00:08:40,260 --> 00:08:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I only wish to see you♪</font>

238
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I agree to what you said</font>

239
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the night of the Shangsi Festival.</font>

240
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life's meetings and partings
are like this.</font>

241
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's enjoy the time we have together.</font>

242
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You told me this.</font>

243
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:55,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've already wasted five years.</font>

244
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much more time
can you afford to lose?</font>

245
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tomb of Elder Sun Hongwen]</font>

246
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who dares rob this grave?</font>

247
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you trespass
on my family's burial ground?</font>

248
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be the caretaker
of this cemetery.</font>

249
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here looking for someone.</font>

250
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't mean to disturb you.</font>

251
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would you be so kind</font>

252
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as to look the other way?</font>

253
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And if I refuse?</font>

254
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you plan to do about it?</font>

255
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

256
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a dignified prince,</font>

257
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you resort to such a childish trick.</font>

258
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I learned from the best.</font>

259
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun Mingcheng's death
is far too convenient.</font>

260
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he is truly dead,</font>

261
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so be it.</font>

262
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he's not dead,</font>

263
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he must be the one playing ghost.</font>

264
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that what you think too?</font>

265
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why you're here so late.</font>

266
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mind your own thoughts.</font>

267
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

268
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to come to see you,</font>

269
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm already dressed up like this.</font>

270
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that sincere enough?</font>

271
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're here for Beiyuan</font>

272
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the investigation,</font>

273
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:40,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not for me.</font>

274
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you always say before</font>

275
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you'd stay by my side</font>

276
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and share every burden with me?</font>

277
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What now?</font>

278
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trying to push me away?</font>

279
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that it?</font>

280
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you come around?</font>

281
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I refuse now,</font>

282
00:10:58,520 --> 00:10:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd probably bury me right here.</font>

283
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You make it sound like I'm forcing you.</font>

284
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll do it gladly.</font>

285
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tomb of My Beloved Sun Mingcheng]</font>

286
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you're so sensible,</font>

287
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hold the lantern for me.</font>

288
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should be the one digging.</font>

289
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This job requires great skill.</font>

290
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grave digging</font>

291
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:27,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">demands speed, force, and precision.</font>

292
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your front hand</font>

293
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should be as far forward as possible.</font>

294
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you need to find the right point</font>

295
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to work fast and save your strength.</font>

296
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,</font>

297
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your hands will blister in no time.</font>

298
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun, you sound</font>

299
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">quite experienced at this.</font>

300
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no choice.</font>

301
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The living often speak lies.</font>

302
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only the dead tell the truth.</font>

303
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, we're done digging.</font>

304
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll know whether Sun Mingcheng</font>

305
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is alive soon enough.</font>

306
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

307
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we must pay our condolences
at his home tomorrow.</font>

308
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Sun Mingcheng's father is proud,</font>

309
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stubborn, and set in his old ways.</font>

310
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's rather difficult to get along with.</font>

311
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you'll be there.</font>

312
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is true.</font>

313
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well then.</font>

314
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, follow my lead.</font>

315
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sun Mansion]</font>

316
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I, Jun Qinglan,</font>

317
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have long admired you, sir,</font>

318
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but fate had not allowed</font>

319
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">me to pay my respects until now.</font>

320
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son never mentioned</font>

321
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that he had a close friend like you.</font>

322
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun is so devoted to his books,</font>

323
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">focusing on his studies.</font>

324
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only natural that he didn't mention</font>

325
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these academy trifles to you.</font>

326
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

327
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jun,</font>

328
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what books do you enjoy reading?</font>

329
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mount Diancang.</font>

330
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mount Diancang?</font>

331
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What book is this?</font>

332
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

333
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have never heard of it.</font>

334
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all about feng shui
and tomb raiding.</font>

335
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course,
you wouldn't have heard of it.</font>

336
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:15,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This book</font>

337
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was found by chance by my young master.</font>

338
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It contains essays</font>

339
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on local customs and folklore.</font>

340
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's no surprise</font>

341
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you haven't heard of it, sir.</font>

342
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes.</font>

343
00:13:25,800 --> 00:13:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As expected of a great house.</font>

344
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even the servants read and write.</font>

345
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps my young master
mentioned it once,</font>

346
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I simply remembered.</font>

347
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun.</font>

348
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here today</font>

349
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to pay my respects to your son</font>

350
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and offer him incense.</font>

351
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that okay?</font>

352
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so thoughtful.</font>

353
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I refuse?</font>

354
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come.</font>

355
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Follow me.</font>

356
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun,</font>

357
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why does your estate</font>

358
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have no servants at all?</font>

359
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An old man like me</font>

360
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't need anyone to wait on me.</font>

361
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tablet of My Beloved Sun Mingcheng]</font>

362
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, I have no servants.</font>

363
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two,</font>

364
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">offer an incense stick to my son.</font>

365
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun,</font>

366
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">may you rest in peace.</font>

367
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jun,</font>

368
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the incense has been offered.</font>

369
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you tell me</font>

370
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why you're here now?</font>

371
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun, what do you mean?</font>

372
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came</font>

373
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">solely to pay respects to Sun.</font>

374
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came to mourn my son,</font>

375
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you arrived empty-handed</font>

376
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without gifts or condolence money.</font>

377
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it were a mere oversight,</font>

378
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you stared directly
at my son's spirit tablet</font>

379
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the moment you entered
the mourning hall.</font>

380
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such ignorance of rites and decorum.</font>

381
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're certainly no friend of my son's.</font>

382
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one beside you</font>

383
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">carries himself with more poise</font>

384
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than you</font>

385
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in speech and manner.</font>

386
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could he be a mere servant?</font>

387
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun, you distrust me</font>

388
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just because I didn't bring a gift</font>

389
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and glanced at the spirit tablet?</font>

390
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A scholarly family of rites indeed.</font>

391
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun, your insight is keen.</font>

392
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our rash intrusion was offensive.</font>

393
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two...</font>

394
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who exactly are you?</font>

395
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun,</font>

396
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did not mean to deceive you.</font>

397
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am on a critical mission</font>

398
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and had no other choice.</font>

399
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am Jun Qinglan,</font>

400
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">coroner of the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

401
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the behest of Mr. Cui Zhan,</font>

402
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm investigating the death of his son,
Cui Tai, who fell into a well.</font>

403
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son was Cui Tai's classmate.</font>

404
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He also died suddenly,
just one day before Cui Tai.</font>

405
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Therefore,</font>

406
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here to look into the details.</font>

407
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive the intrusion.</font>

408
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son was not well acquainted
with Cui Tai.</font>

409
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has already passed on.</font>

410
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you just</font>

411
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">making a fuss over nothing?</font>

412
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If your son were truly dead,</font>

413
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then it would be a fuss over nothing.</font>

414
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But his coffin was completely empty.</font>

415
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There wasn't even a body inside.</font>

416
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One can't help but suspect</font>

417
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's something amiss here.</font>

418
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you find out?</font>

419
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be...</font>

420
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such an outrageous act!</font>

421
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a deed that ruins one's virtue.</font>

422
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you even do it?</font>

423
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This incense is poisoned.</font>

424
00:16:57,780 --> 00:16:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

425
00:17:00,650 --> 00:17:02,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

426
00:17:02,320 --> 00:17:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

427
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

428
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

429
00:17:14,910 --> 00:17:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

430
00:17:19,430 --> 00:17:23,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

431
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:29,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

432
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

433
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

434
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:44,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

435
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:48,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

436
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

437
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:57,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
